  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 6 year rows (昭和3-8年度) + 總數 + 13 官廳 rows (臺北州, 新竹州, 臺中州, 臺南州, 高雄州, 臺東廳, 花蓮港廳, 澎湖廳, 總督府, 交通局, 專賣局, 稅關, 營林所) = 20 rows as printed.",
   "Columns 總數 to 煙草收入 are on p. 674; 酒收入 to 臺灣官設鐵道用品資金過剰金繰入 on p. 675; joined by row. Row labels for the last five rows are printed vertically (總交專稅營 / 督通賣 林 / 府局局關所) and read column-wise.",
   "Right-page figures sit lower than left-page labels (page curvature, offset about 20-25 px at the right edge); assigned by counting rows (8 district rows + 5 central-office rows).",
   "Cell 教科書收入, 總督府: printed '..' (two dots), kept; all other nil cells '…'.",
   "Checks, 官廳別 column sums vs 總數 row: all columns reconcile (diff 0) except 教科書收入 (rows sum 229,371 vs printed 229,372), 森林收入 (2,970,157 vs 2,970,158) and 官有地小作料 (936,065 vs 936,066), each diff 1 — does NOT reconcile; digits re-read, probably rounding in the source.",
   "Checks, rows (printed 總數 minus sum of the 15 item columns): 0 for 昭和4, 5, 8, the 總數 row and the district/office rows except: 昭和3 -1, 昭和6 +3, 昭和7 -1, 臺東廳 +1, 花蓮港廳 +1, 交通局 +1. Source rounding; nothing corrected. No unreadable cells."
  ],
